docs {
  # Submit TACOTS Exit
  
  Submits an exit/completion form for a TACOTS beneficiary who is leaving or has completed the programme. The form captures the student's exit reason, current status, post-programme outcomes, and programme impact assessment.
  
  On success, the exit record is saved to the database. The endpoint returns the newly created exit object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Core
  
  | Field                        | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                                                |
  |------------------------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentId                    | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS student record                                                                                                                                           |
  | schoolAttendedDuringProgram  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                                              |
  | yearOfExit                   | number | Yes      | Integer (e.g. `2025`)                                                                                                                                                       |
  | exitReason                   | string | Yes      | One of: `COMPLETED SECONDARY EDUCATION (GRADUATED)`, `DID NOT MEET PROGRAM REQUIREMENTS`, `DROPPED OUT OF SCHOOL`, `WITHDREW FROM THE PROGRAM`, `RELOCATED / MOVED AWAY`, `PERSONAL OR FAMILY REASONS`, `OTHER` |
  | highestEducationAttained     | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY`, `JUNIOR SECONDARY`, `SENIOR SECONDARY`                                                                                                                  |
  | currentStatus                | string | Yes      | One of: `CONTINUING SECONDARY EDUCATION ELSEWHERE`, `ADMITTED INTO HIGHER INSTITUTION`, `LEARNING A TRADE / VOCATIONAL SKILL`, `EMPLOYED`, `NOT CURRENTLY STUDYING OR WORKING`, `OTHER` |
  | completedBy                  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                                              |
  | submissionDate               | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                                                                                                       |
  
  ### Post-Programme Details (Optional)
  
  | Field                        | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                                |
  |------------------------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | higherInstitutionName        | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                                                               |
  | higherInstitutionCity        | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                                                               |
  | higherInstitutionState       | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                                                               |
  | employmentType               | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                                                               |
  | vocationalSkill              | string | No       | One of: `TAILORING / FASHION DESIGN`, `HAIRDRESSING / BARBING`, `CARPENTRY`, `ELECTRICAL WORK`, `ICT / COMPUTER TRAINING`, `CATERING`, `AUTO MECHANIC`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  | newSchoolName                | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                                                               |
  | completedSecondaryElsewhere  | string | No       | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `CURRENTLY STUDYING`, `NOT SURE` (optional)                                                                                           |
  
  ### Impact Assessment (Optional)
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values     |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------|
  | programImpactDescription | string | No       | Optional free text               |
  | programImpactRating      | number | No       | Integer from `1` to `10`         |
  | additionalSituationInfo  | string | No       | Optional free text               |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created TACOTS exit record.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `create` permission.                               |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                              |
}
